sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>RatingsSection
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>DeleteAnyRatingBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>DeleteAnyRatingController
  participant Rating as «entity»<br/>Rating
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: delete any rating
  UI->>B: DELETE /api/admin/ratings/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: delete(Integer ratingId)
  C->>Rating: delete()
  Rating->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Rating: rows
  Rating-->>C: result
  C-->>B: void
  B-->>UI: 204 No Content
  UI-->>A: show result